    "en": "Only specimen268 in Plate14 Fig9; genus-level original target. Retain aff.osiris uncertainty. Not PRI60021 or S.camachoi, no Eocene/10cm data mixed in. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"height_z\": 0.044, \"total_width_x\": 0.042, \"body_width\": 0.025, \"working_depth_y\": 0.023, \"basis\": \"Weidemeyer p192 table: specimen268 H44.0mm, B25.0mm, wing-inclusiveB42.0mm. Depth23mm is inferred working proportion, not measured.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Adapertural photo shows exterior opposite aperture. Exact unseen interior/rim depth not measured; conserve surviving fossil outline rather than restore missing shell.\"}",
